# Robot 1, auto 4 (autos/LeftCornerWaitLaunchAndPark.java), as RED, when the HIVE never tips: the CELL on the
# left stays down, so the camera never sees the goal. It never fires, and it still parks in the last 4 s.
# Run it from the ftc-helper-lib folder: ./gradlew :sim:scenario -Pfile=../simulator/scenarios/r1-auto-left-corner-no-tip.sim
robot ../robot.properties
init "R1 Left Corner: Wait for Tip, Launch, Park"
press g1.b                                 # RED
wait 0.5
start
expect within 30 phase STOPPED
wait 0.5
expect launched = 0                        # no tip: no shots
expect stored = 4                          # the four POLLEN are still in the robot
expect screen has "To the LOADING ZONE: done"
expect bumped none
expect points "red" >= 8                   # LEAVE 3 + PARK 5
